  "text": "Through direct intervention in the mortal world, a deity creates a deific vessel to do their will, whether from a willing servant or through possession, a contract, or a curse. A candle to the flame of their progenitor, a divine vessel burns fast and quickly extinguishes.\n\n---\nReligions inspire devout individuals to uphold their tenets."
